+# TASK-015 round 2: the compaction hook names the phase module (corrections)
+
+## Objective
+Round 1 (`handoff/TASK-015.md`, your report `handoff/TASK-015-r1-report.md`) is in the working tree and mostly right; the reviewers found one blocking defect and five items to fix in the same round. This brief lists only the corrections. `handoff/TASK-015.md` still holds in full (Context, Requirements 1 to 12, Constraints, Development data); where this brief says otherwise, this brief wins. The rounds land with TASK-010 as one merge unit.
+
+Satisfies:
+- R-005: The compaction/session-start hook names the current phase's module(s) to re-read after a compaction (one for most phases; planning and building map to two), plus the conditional-workflow files (type, sub-type, trait) that touch the current phase; it carries the Phase→module table for every template phase value, including the reflection and project-end modules and any further files the phase re-reads.
+
+## Scope
+Files you may create or modify:
+- bridge/cursor-bridge/session-start.py
+- bridge/cursor-bridge/MANIFEST.json (regenerated by `python tools/make-manifest.py`, never by hand)
+- docs/cli-reference.json (regenerated by `python tools/dump-cli.py`, never by hand)
+- docs/CLI_REFERENCE.md (regenerated by `python tools/dump-cli.py`, never by hand)
+- docs/BUILDER_NOTES.md
+- handoff/TASK-015-r2-report.md
+
+Do not modify anything else. Leave `handoff/TASK-015-r1-report.md` as it is.
